"""
report_generator.py — Perseus branded PDF
=========================================
Renders one period's variance analysis and its standalone fee proposal as a
Camelot-branded PDF, using the same visual system as `report_bot` and CostBeat —
dark navy #1A2645 bands, Camelot gold #C9A84C accents, Helvetica, and a
"Generated by Camelot OS · Perseus" footer.

Sections, in order:
  1. Header — property, address, period
  2. Where the period landed — the plain-language read
  3. Budget vs. Actual — Line Item | Budget Share | Actual | Variance | % | Status
  4. Portfolio comparison — Line Item | Annualized | Portfolio Avg | Target |
     Savings | % | How We Get There
  5. Addressable savings total and coverage disclosure
  6. Fee proposal for this period only — both options, recommended one highlighted
  7. Follow-up checklist
  8. Legend and caveat footer

Copy follows Camelot's house voice: a number never leads a sentence on its own —
it is stated with what it means; one statistic per sentence; no hedging and no
sales adjectives.

Author: Camelot OS
"""

